			"notes": "A New Years Update for 1.16, before looking forward at 1.18.\n\n### Changes\n\n- Removed the crafting recipe for a vanilla soul campfire - it can now be made with the [Fire starter](https://github.com/alcatrazEscapee/no-tree-punching/wiki/FireStarter) by adding one soul soil or soul sand to the normal items to make a campfire. (#213)\n- Added config options to disable both crafting functions of the fire starter (`fireStarterCanMakeCampfire` and `fireStarterCanMakeSoulCampfire` respectively).\n- The clay tool now uses a config-defined sequence of blocks, meaning new blocks can be added, or removed, from the clay tool (`potteryBlockSequences`) (#211)"
		},
